          "explanation": "The book imagines a strike of the mind: inventors, industrialists, and other originators quietly withdraw, and a society that depends on them while condemning them starts to fall apart. The first option is the ordinary labor strike Rand deliberately reverses. There is no sudden overnight dictatorship -- the decline is gradual, through laws and pressure -- and the heroine runs her railroad rather than giving it away.",
