            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE ANSWER ARRIVES</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">The slang question meets its man</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"200\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WHO IS JOHN GALT?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">A shrug of despair used</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">all through the novel</text><path d=\"M550 400 L550 490\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polygon points=\"550,500 540,482 560,482\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"510\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THIS IS JOHN GALT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Despair turns into</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">an argument</text></svg>",
            "caption": "The book's catchphrase finally gets its answer on live radio."
