"760\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"820\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">6.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"820\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Keep a take / argue notebook</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"900\" width=\"700\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"955\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">The notebook is your real takeaway</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Six steps to reading the whole novel without losing the thread."
